Experimental Protocol
---------------------
  Paradigm: imagery
  Number of classes: 2
  Class labels: cooperate, independent
  Trial duration: 2.0 s
  Study design: Auditory beep + visual cue. 5 beeps at T=1.4s rhythm. Analyzed: 5s after last beep. Each 5s trial is split into 3 overlapping epochs of 2s.
  Stimulus type: auditory + visual cue
  Stimulus modalities: auditory, visual
  Primary modality: auditory
  Synchronicity: synchronous
  Mode: offline

